<title>INDIA: Major Indian stock markets closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Major Indian stock markets closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bombay Stock Exchange and the National Stock Exchange, are closed on Tuesday for a holiday.</p>
<p>The stock markets reopen on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Share prices ended flat on the National Stock Exchange (NSE), the only bourse to be open on Monday. The 50-share NSE index ended 14.67 points or 1.67 percent up at 894.67 on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
